   <text><body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1r"/>
            <p>Darf ich Sie, theurer <lb/>Freund, einmal wieder <lb/>belästigen. Ich finde <lb/>in
                  <ref xml:id="b97bff1b-4e3e-47e8-bbff-1b4e3e37e866" corresp="#c60d6e49-a37c-487f-8d6e-49a37c287fda" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0016926 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118871692">Niccolo di Conti</persName>
                     <lb/>Reise nach den Mo<lb break="no"/>lukken</ref><note xml:id="c60d6e49-a37c-487f-8d6e-49a37c287fda" corresp="#b97bff1b-4e3e-47e8-bbff-1b4e3e37e866" type="editorial">
                     <bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/NS5NRSV3">Ramusio 1554-1559</bibl>
                  </note> (er kam <lb/>zurük
               1447
               also
               <lb/>73Jahre
               vor <ref xml:id="b68d18fc-94fb-4f8f-8d18-fc94fb0f8f0c" corresp="#bc19630d-6327-4d39-9963-0d63274d39dc" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0013857 http://d-nb.info/gnd/117518530">Ma<lb break="no"/>gellan</persName>
                     <choice>
                        <abbr>u</abbr>
                        <expan>und</expan>
                     </choice>
                     <persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0001978 http://d-nb.info/gnd/119316498">Pigafetta</persName></ref><note xml:id="bc19630d-6327-4d39-9963-0d63274d39dc" corresp="#b68d18fc-94fb-4f8f-8d18-fc94fb0f8f0c" type="editorial">
                     <bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/L5BEJ57U">Pigafetta 1784</bibl>
                  </note>) <lb/>den Paradis Vogel <lb/>beschrieben. Wollten <lb/>Sie wohl gütigst
               <lb/>in <ref xml:id="b3e6edd9-ab44-4dd2-a6ed-d9ab44ddd2f4" corresp="#f72d7469-087b-45a3-ad74-69087b85a3ae" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0003752 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118517252">Buffon</persName></ref><note xml:id="f72d7469-087b-45a3-ad74-69087b85a3ae" corresp="#b3e6edd9-ab44-4dd2-a6ed-d9ab44ddd2f4" type="editorial">
                     <bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/ND3SVK5F">Buffon 1749–1789</bibl>
                  </note>
               <choice>
                  <abbr>od.</abbr>
                  <expan>oder</expan>
               </choice> sonst<lb break="no"/>wo (<ref xml:id="c10e0360-6e10-4c0e-8e03-606e101c0ef0" corresp="#d134e894-37c9-4bac-b4e8-9437c92bac30" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0016875 https://d-nb.info/gnd/116960183">Vaillant</persName></ref><note xml:id="d134e894-37c9-4bac-b4e8-9437c92bac30" corresp="#c10e0360-6e10-4c0e-8e03-606e101c0ef0" type="editorial">
                     <bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/DFQJL5JM">Levaillant 1805-1808</bibl>
                  </note>?) <lb/>nachsehen wem <lb/>man erste Nach<lb break="no"/>richt
                  zuschreibt<supplied cert="high">.</supplied>
               <lb/>In <bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/CWSDAFQZ"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0000178 http://d-nb.info/gnd/118534432">Forster</persName> Zoologia <lb/>indica <choice>
                     <abbr>p</abbr>
                     <expan>pagina</expan>
                  </choice> 31</bibl> ist nur <lb/><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0001978 http://d-nb.info/gnd/119316498">Pigafetta</persName>
                  genannt<supplied cert="high">.</supplied></p>
            <closer rend="paragraph"><signed>Ihr <lb/>A Humboldt</signed>
               <dateline>Donnerstags</dateline>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body></text>
